r speed is increased during this form, allowing you to traverse the Map and slaughter your prey with deadly efficacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019590/extras/1ca02aa98045586bb0b66983f71f7fac.poster.avif?t=1758653588\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019590/extras/1ca02aa98045586bb0b66983f71f7fac.webm?t=1758653588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019590/extras/1ca02aa98045586bb0b66983f71f7fac.mp4?t=1758653588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hunt on foot, regurgitate a projectile at Survivors and infect them with the Leeching Gland. Infected Survivors are far more vulnerable to Intestinal whip attacks, leaving you in a prime position to switch forms and inflict true misery upon them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019590/extras/697c7e049c3b0da38e4fbd667b87868f.poster.avif?t=1758653588\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019590/extras/697c7e049c3b0da38e4fbd667b87868f.webm?t=1758653588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019590/extras/697c7e049c3b0da38e4fbd667b87868f.mp4?t=1758653588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Krasue\u2019s Perks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hex: Overture of Doom:</strong> \u00a0Curse a Generator to mislead Survivors with a false Terror Radius, allowing you to approach them undetected and catch them off guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ravenous: </strong>After every Survivor has been Hooked once, they will scream and temporarily become Exposed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wandering Eye: </strong>While chasing a Survivor, the Aura of all nearby injured Survivors will be briefly revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019590/extras/7dd210d1f8add157827f77fae46286f9.poster.avif?t=1758653588\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019590/extras/7dd210d1f8add157827f77fae46286f9.webm?t=1758653588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019590/extras/7dd210d1f8add157827f77fae46286f9.mp4?t=1758653588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Vee Boonyasak</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The beating heart of Axekick, drummer Vee Boonyasak's infectious attitude, up-tempo pace, and kinetic energy bring a new dynamic to every Trial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019590/extras/0ba8b2eea637debfc004873ec3faaf94.poster.avif?t=1758653588\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019590/extras/0ba8b2eea637debfc004873ec3faaf94.webm?t=1758653588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019590/extras/0ba8b2eea637debfc004873ec3faaf94.mp4?t=1758653588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Vee Boonyasak\u2019s Perks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost Notes </strong>allows you to recover from Exhaustion faster. Not only that, your Scratch Marks will disappear quicker too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>ONE-TWO-THREE-FOUR!</strong> to kick off a performance that will invigorate your teammates, empowering them with a slew of Skill Checks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>Road Life,</strong> complete Repair Great Skill Checks while injured to earn Tokens, which can be spent to heal a Health State.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019590/extras/cc7f87aa3199824e6d894085a30a2466.poster.avif?t=1758653588\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019590/extras/cc7f87aa3199824e6d894085a30a2466.webm?t=1758653588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019590/extras/cc7f87aa3199824e6d894085a30a2466.mp4?t=1758653588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Exclusive Chapter Cosmetics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Sinister Grace Chapter includes an exclusive Cosmetic for both characters: The Krasue\u2019s <strong>Relaxed Reds,</strong> and Vee Boonyasak\u2019s <strong>Camo Cami.\u00a0 </strong>These are only available as part of the DLC, and cannot be purchased separately. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-ali